WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.790
One decision at a time — Save context. Review an investigation.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:18.810
First decision: save the incident context for the next person.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:34.980
Jordan skips saving the note. The next action is a separate decision.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.310
Second decision: review the investigation command. This capability is set to Ask.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:45.120
Review the target and command. Jordan approves the service-status check.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:49.940
The approved check returns its result. Demo device output is simulated.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:54.320
Your approval sets the boundary. — Two proposals. Two separate decisions.
